      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GO GO CAMBLA (1) has shown good improvement at her last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 3rd at this track over 390m. Sure to be about the mark. MAJESTIC ONE (2) turned in a plain performance last time when eighth at this track over 352m behind Lakoda Focus (20.68) in a Mix 5. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in three starts. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. CHEAP PERFUME (7) has been out of the placings last two but shapes well for this if she can recapture her handy win a few runs back, getting around Capalaba over 366m in 19.77. Smart winner three back and looks a key chance on that form.",
